WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:17.044
Oliver was getting glasses.

2
00:00:17.045 --> 00:00:22.365
"I don't want to wear glasses," said Oliver.

3
00:00:22.366 --> 00:00:37.399
"Glasses will help you to see," said Mom.

4
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.811
"I can see fine now," Oliver grumbled.

5
00:00:40.812 --> 00:00:49.324
Mom and Oliver drove to the store.

6
00:00:49.325 --> 00:00:56.081
Oliver put on his new glasses.

7
00:00:56.082 --> 00:01:00.122
"I look terrible," said Oliver.

8
00:01:00.123 --> 00:01:03.968
"You look handsome," said Mom.

9
00:01:03.969 --> 00:01:08.220
"And now you will see much better."

10
00:01:08.221 --> 00:01:12.533
That night the ice cream truck came.

11
00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:21.454
Mom gave Harry a bunch of coins.

12
00:01:21.455 --> 00:01:26.570
The kids ran after the ice cream truck.

13
00:01:26.571 --> 00:01:29.892
"Wait!" yelled Oliver.

14
00:01:29.893 --> 00:01:34.369
"We want ice cream!" yelled Harry.

15
00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:38.975
Oliver, Harry, and Emmy raced down the street.

16
00:01:38.976 --> 00:01:41.342
Suddenly Harry tripped.

17
00:01:41.343 --> 00:01:43.891
All the money flew into the air.

18
00:01:43.892 --> 00:01:49.516
Coins bounced all over the sidewalk.

19
00:01:49.517 --> 00:01:54.898
The kids picked up the coins.

20
00:01:54.899 --> 00:01:58.543
But two coins were still missing.

21
00:01:58.544 --> 00:02:02.232
"Oh no," said Emmy.

22
00:02:02.233 --> 00:02:06.456
"We don't have enough money."

23
00:02:06.457 --> 00:02:13.984
"Now we can't get ice cream," said Harry.

24
00:02:13.985 --> 00:02:18.442
Just then Oliver spotted something.

25
00:02:18.443 --> 00:02:23.300
It was two shiny quarters!

26
00:02:23.301 --> 00:02:28.701
"We can get ice cream!" said Oliver.

27
00:02:28.702 --> 00:02:32.428
"Good job, Oliver!" said Emmy.

28
00:02:32.429 --> 00:02:41.277
"You found the missing coins."

29
00:02:41.278 --> 00:02:44.585
"Mmm . . .," said Harry.

30
00:02:44.586 --> 00:02:49.038
"I love ice cream," said Emmy.

31
00:02:49.039 --> 00:02:52.302
"Me too," said Oliver.

32
00:02:52.303 --> 00:02:57.702
"I'm so glad that I got new glasses!"
